ils\n- Fixed mobile jump button\n- Re-added FFA and Gun Game score UI\n- Adjusted blue v orange score UI \n\nI'm working at another roblox game studio, I was dev on the Jaws: Infested Waters experience, so this is still a side thing that I'm not going to update for very much longer.","path":"/game/625364452-foam-fps","slug":"625364452-foam-fps","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/47f82258c63447d9b06656a39379794f488d9bd48760c94b7fe1c375b3220cad.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-560fc888332b9b97b758687202518193/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":50510010,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-09-08T15:09:23.576Z","creator":{"name":"IsaacThePooper","type":"User"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":648362523,"name":"Breaking Point","desc":"Update V8.2\r\n - Default theme\r\n - New command: !join mode-name (e.g. !join fr)\r\n - Fixes","path":"/game/648362523-breaking-point","slug":"648362523-breaking-point","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/0f2a85f1ac120d297fb32cbb2b1c7ff83915b0aca77a0d664a98609abc4431c7.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0136eb65b94aeb8de7a1c8063ec9a5e5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":1358381997,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-22T23:08:45.517Z","creator":{"name":"Paradox","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":31,"freeCount":30,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":3}},{"id":583507031,"name":"PAPERS, PLEASE! [❗UPDATE]","desc":"🌿💼 𝐖𝐄𝐋𝐂𝐎𝐌𝐄 𝐓𝐎 𝐓𝐇𝐄 𝐆𝐑𝐄𝐒𝐓𝐈𝐍 𝐅𝐄𝐃𝐄𝐑𝐀𝐋 𝐁𝐎𝐑𝐃𝐄𝐑!\nYour objective is to cross the heavily guarded border checkpoint - alive. Immigrate using your personal documents or attempt to sneak past the Border Guards. Or, rebel against the regime and fight back with EZIC to reclaim territory.\nReady to cross the line? Play now & shape your life.\n\nPapers, Please is a roleplay game where players attempt to immigrate into the fictional city of Grestin. Cross the imperialist fortress and work a job to get paid, or live a life of crime - 